  "fullDescription": "30 Luxury Glitter Brushes for Procreate\n\nGlitter Brushes for Procreate is a set of 30 brushes for the Procreate app that creates a subtle sparkle effect to your drawings. These brushes have been designed to work with any drawing and will give your work an extra special touch.\n\nThis Procreate Glitter Brush Set includes: lettering glitter brushes, rainbow glitter brushes, glitter overlay, abstract glitter brushes, stars, fire, outline glitter brushes, soft glitter, hard glitter, big glitter, glitter stamps, glitter patterns, gold flicks, gold splatter and much more.\n\nThe perfect tool for adding an extra bit of sparkle and glamour to your every day. These brushes are so versatile and can be used as a cosmetic brush, painting brush or for adding extra glitter to your artwork.\n\nGlitter Brushes are the latest trend in Procreate. These brushes can create a variety of looks with just one swipe. From subtle sparkles to intense bursts of glitter, these brushes will inspire you make your drawings pop from any angle.\n\nMake your drawing experience even more glamorous! These high-quality brushes will make your drawings shimmer like never before. You’ll have a sparkling time with these brushes, whether you’re drawing rainbows or painting the stars.\n\nThese brushes allow you to create bright, beautiful designs that will stand out.\n\nYou can change the color, size and opacity of these Procreate brushes.\n\nThey are perfect for creating backgrounds, borders, and foregrounds to complement any project.\nThis brush set makes your design fast and easy to create.\nThis brush set is only works with Procreate app.\n\nRequired:\n• iPad Pro or iPad\n• Apple pencil (or pen that supports pressure sensitivity)\n• Procreate Version 5.0 and higher (App)\n\nSave your time!\nI hope you’ll enjoy using these stamps brushes created for you.\n\nUsing these stamps, you can create paintings with a variety of styles and techniques.\n\nPainting can be a lot of fun, but sometimes it’s a little difficult to get the perfect design.\nThese stamps are a great way to add some extra creativity and detail to your paintings, or just as a decoration for an art project.\n\n******************************************************************************************\nREFUNDS\n\nAll purchases are final. Refunds cannot be given for instant downloads as they are sent instantly and therefore cannot be returned or exchanged. Please read the item description to fully aware of what you are purchasing. If clarification is required about anything, please send a message prior to purchase.\n\nThank you for your visit.",
